Subject: [PATCH] Compare YTS JSON numbers as float64

encoding/json decodes every number in in.json to float64, but go-yaml
loads integers as int, so reflect.DeepEqual failed for every test case
with an integer in it. Convert the integers in the loaded YAML value to
float64 before comparing, and stop listing the 33 JSONComparisonTest
cases that now pass as known failures.
---
 yts/known-failing-tests | 33 ---------------------------------
 yts/test_suite_test.go  | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

